i-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Ammunition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.70 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 - 12 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120622190155&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Envenomed_Arrow_80c097.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an envenomed arrow.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 70 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.70 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This arrow has a combined attack of 54 (half earth, half physical). It will output acceptable damage and on earth-neutral or weak monsters will be more efficient than Prismatic Bolts (3.3 atk/gp vs. 4.5 atk/gp). However, many high-end creatures are immune or strong to Earth Damage. \n</p><p>The main use of these arrows for Paladins upon reaching Level 70 is to complete the Quara Scout task of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a> until Level 79 and then the Underwater Quara task after reaching Level 80. This could be dangerous without a shield and Level 70-100 Paladins should be extremely careful not to get swarmed because Quaras hit very hard with melee. Alternatively, they can be used to hunt <a href=\"#/wiki/Shaburak%20Demon\">Shaburak Demons</a>. \n</p><p>Other than those two uses, they can also be used effectively against the much weaker <a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarians\">Barbarians</a> (but not Ice Witches), <a href=\"#/wiki/Orcs\">Orcs</a> and Cyclopes. <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Gladiator\">Undead Gladiators</a>, however, which are weak to Envenomed Arrows, should only be hunted in Yalahar because the <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Ruins\">Krailos Ruins</a> contain creatures which are immune to Earth Damage. Overall, most Paladins upon reaching Level 70 elect to instead use the crossbow ammunition counterpart, the Drill Bolt, which deals entirely physical damage.\n</p><p>Paladins can explore the Earth Damage/Weak page and sort the list by experience to find creatures in their difficulty range for which these arrows would be effective to use.\n</p><p>15 of them can be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Adult%20Goanna\">Adult Goanna</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Armadile\">Armadile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earworm